OL,3,AUK announces sanctions on Israeli
OL,4,Asettlements in West Bank and accuses
OL,5,Asettlers of 'ethnic cleansing'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt follows Foreign Secretary Ed
OL,8,FMiliband announcing the UK will ban the
OL,9,Fimport of goods from Israeli
OL,10,Fsettlements in the illegally occupied
OL,11,FWest Bank
OL,13,FSpeaking in Parliament, UK Foreign
OL,14,FSecretary Ed Miliband says "ethnic
OL,15,Fcleansing" is being carried out by
OL,16,F"settler terrorists" and accuses the
OL,17,FIsraeli government of turning a "blind
OL,18,Feye"
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
